# Tutorial 6's Strategies step needs no battle set up (docs/LEARNING.md "Getting back";
# docs/BUILDING.md "Input scripts"): started at step 15, the simulator opens by the way back
# (Designs, then its Combat Simulator button); closed with Free Play on, the lesson stays at step 15
# and only shows the way back again. Strategies then opens from the reopened, empty simulator.
# layouts: both (also plays at 800x600: run_input_tests.py --small)
options --tutorial=combat:15 --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800

wait-lesson combat
wait-step 15
click tag:command:designs
wait-window designs
click tag:designs:simulator
wait-window combat-simulator
click item:More in=lesson optional
click tag:lesson:free-play
key Escape
wait-closed combat-simulator
click item:More in=lesson optional
click tag:lesson:free-play
wait 10
assert-step 15
wait-for item:"hint:The Combat Simulator window was closed. Press*" in=lesson
click tag:designs:simulator
wait-window combat-simulator
click tag:combat-simulator:strategies
wait-window strategies
wait-step 16
